# 首次公开的根目录清单。个人笔记、附件、生成图标原稿与导出目录留在本机。
/*
!/.gitignore
!/.github/
!/AGENTS.md
!/README.md
!/SECURITY.md
!/LICENSE
!/AgRoom/
!/docs/

/docs/*
!/docs/wiki/
!/docs/design/
/docs/design/*
!/docs/design/2026-markdown-rendering-design.md
!/docs/wiki/**/*.md
/docs/wiki/tools/

/AgRoom/*
!/AgRoom/AgRoom.xcodeproj/
!/AgRoom/Config/
!/AgRoom/Package.swift
!/AgRoom/Package.resolved
!/AgRoom/project.yml
!/AgRoom/bump_version.sh
!/AgRoom/Resources/
!/AgRoom/Sources/
!/AgRoom/Tests/
!/AgRoom/vendor/
!/AgRoom/scripts/
/AgRoom/Config/*
!/AgRoom/Config/Signing.xcconfig
/AgRoom/scripts/*
!/AgRoom/scripts/package.sh
!/AgRoom/scripts/verify-boringssl-analyzer.sh
!/AgRoom/scripts/verify-knowledge-runtime.sh
!/AgRoom/scripts/verify-script-runners.sh
!/AgRoom/scripts/prepare-knowledge-runtime.py
!/AgRoom/scripts/summarize-coding-eval.py
!/AgRoom/scripts/knowledge-embedding-main.cpp
!/AgRoom/scripts/intent-routing-main.cpp
/AgRoom/vendor/*
!/AgRoom/vendor/MailFoundation/
!/AgRoom/vendor/mysql-nio/
!/AgRoom/vendor/swift-nio-ssl/

# 项目文档、许可证、共享 scheme 和随包推理程序应覆盖开发机上的全局忽略规则。
!/AgRoom/Sources/**/*.md
!/AgRoom/vendor/**/*.md
!/AgRoom/AgRoom.xcodeproj/xcshareddata/xcschemes/*.xcscheme
!/AgRoom/Sources/AgRoom/EmbeddingRuntime/*/*.dylib
/AgRoom/Sources/AgRoom/EmbeddingRuntime-prepared/
/AgRoom/Sources/AgRoom/EmbeddingRuntime-previous/
.swiftpm/
xcuserdata/
*.xcuserstate
*.xccheckout
*.xcscmblueprint
**/xcshareddata/swiftpm/configuration/
.build/
DerivedData/
*.xcresult/
*.xcarchive/
.DS_Store
._*
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]

